# nervepack lifecycle-hook registration manifest -- read by np_hook.install_hooks()
# (dispatched as `cli.py setup install-hooks`). One pipe-delimited row per hook:
#   event|matcher|command
# Rows are registered in FILE ORDER; order matters within an event -- in
# particular session-flush MUST be the LAST SessionEnd row so it runs after
# episodic-capture + evaluator have written this session to the inboxes.
# matcher is empty for all but the tool-scoped PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks.
# Backgrounded commands keep their `>/dev/null 2>&1 &` (or bare ` &`): the `&`
# alone does NOT detach -- the child inherits the hook's stdout pipe and Claude
# Code reads it to EOF, so an un-redirected backgrounded hook blocks session
# start until the child exits. See np-kb-claude-headless-scripting.
# Retired the 11 NN-install-*.sh installers + np-hook-lib.sh (phase 13).
#
# --- 50: sync + dashboard (sync is cli.py-dispatched; 40-sync-nervepack.sh retired, phase 17) ---
SessionStart||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py sync >/dev/null 2>&1 &
SessionEnd||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py sync exit >/dev/null 2>&1 &
SessionStart||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook open-dashboard >/dev/null 2>&1 &
# --- 51: consult-nervepack directive (synchronous) ---
SessionStart||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook session-directive
# --- 52: episodic capture + recall ---
SessionEnd||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-capture session-end &
PreCompact||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-capture checkpoint
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook episodic-recall
# --- 53: lessons layer (two lesson-guard matchers coexist via (matcher, base) dedup) ---
PreToolUse|Bash|python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
PreToolUse|Read|python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-guard
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook lesson-recall
# --- 54: performance evaluator ---
SessionEnd||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook evaluator &
# --- 55: promotion flush (LAST SessionEnd row -- see header) ---
SessionEnd||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook session-flush
# --- 56: back-capture sweep (reliable capture path) ---
SessionStart||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook backcapture-sweep >/dev/null 2>&1 &
# --- 57: struggle escalation ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook struggle-escalation
# --- 59: skill-trigger recall ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook skill-trigger-recall
# --- 59b: security-review recall ---
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook security-recall
# --- 61: resume pointer ---
SessionStart||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook resume-sessionstart &
UserPromptSubmit||python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook resume-recall
# --- 63: open artifact on write (Write-scoped) ---
PostToolUse|Write|python3 ~/Code/nervepack/engine/nervepack_engine/cli.py hook open-artifact
